Add a --without-default-spammers flag that skips inserting the 25 built-in default
spammer templates on first launch. Those defaults are 1559/blob-centric and most cannot
run on a pre-London ETC chain; leaving them out keeps the dashboard to just the devnet's
own configured spammers instead of a wall of paused, inapplicable templates.

--- a/cmd/spamoor-daemon/main.go
+++ b/cmd/spamoor-daemon/main.go
@@ -35,6 +35,7 @@ type CliArgs struct {
 	startupDefaults      []string
 	fuluActivation       uint64
 	withoutBatcher       bool
+	withoutDefaultSpammers bool
 	disableTxMetrics     bool
